WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.840
This is the singularity... one day at a time.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.520
Here's the last 24 hours in AI. Sorry... SI.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.740
OpenAI is rolling out GPT-6 to everyone on ChatGPT, free users included.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:24.360
Answers now come with charts, buttons and mini-apps.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:31.320
Claude Haiku 5.5 is here: around 75% cheaper to run than Haiku 4.5.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:34.650
Musk's Grok Bot will now hand tasks to the best model,

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.350
including Anthropic's Claude and Midjourney.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.840
A Reuters/Ipsos poll: nearly 60% of voters

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.840
say Trump isn't taking AI risks seriously.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.260
In AI's hometown,

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:52.840
San Francisco just paused new data centres for 45 days. So did Oakland.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.900
Thursday, Trump attends an AI science summit,

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.490
and a startup plans to donate $100 million in compute.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.450
Money: Broadcom is reportedly lining up more than

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.030
$50 billion of financing for OpenAI's custom chip.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:13.700
Open-source lab Nous Research raised $90 million at a $1.5 billion valuation.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.850
Disruptive, an early Groq backer, is reportedly raising a $10 billion megafund.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.080
And the IMF's chief says AI could lift global

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.840
growth by up to half a percentage point a year.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.910
Science: Biohub, Google,

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:36.990
Meta and the US are putting $1.8 billion toward a virtual cell.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.920
And Danaher will open an AI-run lab in 2027,

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.190
aiming to find molecules up to 8x faster.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.970
The catch? Common Sense Media rated ChatGPT for Teens an unacceptable risk.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:55.080
And an AI music fraudster got 18 months.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.370
So... is it so over?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.450
We're so back!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:08.940
Machines: Microsoft's Nvidia-powered Surface Laptop Ultra starts at $2,599.

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.380
Microsoft says Meta's Muse agent,

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.730
number one on Apple's App Store, is coming to Windows.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.850
Sequoia led a $60 million round for Mecka,

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:21.310
which turns human motion into robot training data.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:27.960
And Musk says Tesla and SpaceX will build and run the Terafab chip complex themselves,

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:28.650
not TSMC.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.370
Every day, the curve gets steeper.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.970
Every day, the future shows up a little earlier.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.030
That was 24 hours. Tomorrow will be faster.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.250
This has been the singularity, one day at a time.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.080
Feel the SI.
